abstract: >
  A computational particle physics project using CMS Open Data to reconstruct and characterise Z-boson and J/psi resonances through invariant-mass spectroscopy, event selection, statistical model comparison and line-shape fitting. The results are presented through Jupyter notebooks backed by Python scripts, and in a polished manner via a publishable report.
